226 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (ACC members continued to lead this fall. Please join us in welcoming our newest member, REDF Impact Investing Fund \(RIIF\), which joined ACC in August 2026. RIIF is a U.S. Treasury-certified Community Development Financial Institution \(CDFI\) with a national track record of providing flexible financing to businesses creating quality jobs. Since 2019, RIIF has completed more than 50 investments across 17 states and Washington, D.C., building extensive expertise in underwriting, portfolio management, and impact investing. Its investment platform includes the Appalachian Growth Fund \(AGF\), which provides revenue-based financing, structured debt, and mission-aligned equity, and the Appalachian Emerging Investors Fund \(AEIF\), which supports earlier-stage businesses positioned for growth. Launched in 2025, AGF has already invested across West Virginia, Virginia, North Carolina, and Kentucky and represents approximately $60 million in projects.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11 304 0 R 13]
>>
endobj
