/Pg 13 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (Shaping the national conversation. At OFN's Small Business Finance Forum, OFN42, SOCAP Global, Climate Week NYC, and other national gatherings, our team contributed to discussions on rural investment, small business resilience, climate finance, and the future of community development finance.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
232 0 obj
<<
