/P 91 0 R
/E (Sharing expertise and solutions. DeepRoots Data Hub team members contributed to conversations on shared CDFI systems, data infrastructure, and rural investment. At OFN42, ACC also previewed its forthcoming Small Business Finance Disaster Resilience Toolkit, developed with LISC.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [19]
>>
